    "summary": "Summoned by Slaughter triggers in any phase when a unit loses its last model and that model is still on the battlefield. For a destroyed TRANSPORT, disembark its passengers first. Pick one of your BLOODLETTERS units from Reserves. Place the whole unit inside the destroyed model’s 9″ radius, leaving a horizontal gap greater than 6″ to each enemy unit. Take the destroyed model off the table after placing the Bloodletters. The limit is one use per battle round.",
